/S /P
/E (As mentioned above, the only companies operating are artisanal mining-waste companies \(karta\), and their production rates in previous years, along with their CSR expenditures, according to official state records \(SMRC, 2022\), are as follows:)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
